      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first Buc‑ee’s store opened in Lake Jackson, making the city the headquarters of the popular gas‑station chain.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Jackson%2C_Texas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lake Jackson Historical Museum, located at 249 Circle Way, showcases the town’s origins and the story of the Dow Chemical plant.",
